ace pod and  somebody  is trapped inside  [Music]  get yourself into replay mode and get  your camera close enough and you can see  inside is a very detailed character  this guy must be important to the season  or maybe the storyline  expect to be click-baited hard by those  terrible youtubers over the next week  but on the plus side this opens up so  many possibilities  the green beacon looks to have attracted  a space vessel  and this will likely mean a new poi  which will grow from this point  maybe a space station maybe an alien  colony  i can't wait to find out but i have one  question above all others  did graham the gnome call in the space  adventurers  is this why graham is found at the radio  tower i always knew graham was the  mastermind behind battle royale loops  but now we have more evidence you guys  who like story theories now is your time  to flex in the comments  is area 69 coming to fortnite is it  sorry is area 51 coming to fortnite  my bad moving on  [Music]  now let's rock up to the crustaceans on  the island near the lighthouse  over the last few weeks those bouncy  inhabitants set up a basic settlement on  the beach  before being joined by pirate  adventurers last update  well this week they have joined the  stone age of evolution  becoming akin to the egyptian empire  with a freaking pyramid  that's impressive building skills maybe  we should get these guys to build hut  watch  so it's finished in less than two years  the settlement continues to evolve as  more villagers move in  these guys are here to stay and by the  looks of things  there's going to be a ton of them by the  end of season 3. in addition to these  crustaceans there are some secret ones  to be found  back on the original coral island there  was an impressive clam chest  well now the water is receding take a  look at it again because you'll notice  the egyptian crustaceans are beginning  to build something in stone  what do you think that could be also  also that's terrible i'